    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41889" root="وز" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَزٌّ</span></b>  a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِوَزٌّ</span>, (S, K,) <i>A kind of water-fowl;</i> (S;) [the <i>goose,</i> or <i>geese;</i> and the <i>duck,</i>
or <i>ducks;</i> but generally the former of these
birds;] as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَزِّينٌ</span></b> : (K:) n. un. of the
former, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَزَّةٌ</span>; (Msb, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وز</span>;) and of the latter,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَزِّينَةٌ</span>. (Sgh, TA.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُرْكىّ</span>.

